      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-17730",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the data sets $x$ and $y$ of paired observations. The equation of the corresponding quadratic regression curve for this data is\n$y =-0.1x^{2} + 3x + 1.5$.\nWhat is the residual at $x = 10$ if the actual value of $y$ corresponding to this $x$-value is $21$?\n\n> A scientific calculator is required to answer this question."
