      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-17732",
      ":question/problem": "![](images/78/787dd545d4f3a6eb715a6a6e5fbf81f3b897ed79024b4256ecd08467a29bd77e.png)\n\nA manager of a company that produces motorcycles has records showing how the company's monthly profit $y$ (in thousands of dollars) depends on the number of motorcycles $x$ produced per month. The scatter plot for the data and the corresponding quadratic regression curve are shown above.\n\nAccording to the regression model, what is the residual for the highlighted data point?\n\n> A scientific calculator is required to answer this question."
